  "body": "We should spell out the fact that the `unsigned` field of PDUs received over S2S should be stripped of everything except an explicitly allowed set of keys, to prevent issues as described in https://github.com/matrix-org/synapse/issues/11080.\r\n\r\nSynapse already has [mitigations](https://github.com/matrix-org/synapse/pull/11530) for this, as does [Dendrite](https://github.com/matrix-org/gomatrixserverlib/pull/300).",
